Your turn, in your own Ubuntu virtual machine.

201
00:06:13,078 --> 00:06:16,982
One: get the lesson folder, and activate your virtual environment.

202
00:06:17,532 --> 00:06:20,050
Two: start the lab API in one terminal.

203
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:25,485
Three: write fetch retry dot P Y with a loop of four attempts and a timeout.

204
00:06:26,035 --> 00:06:29,896
Four: catch request exception, and log each failure with logging.

205
00:06:30,446 --> 00:06:34,713
Five: wait longer after each failure, and give up with exit code one.

