208
00:06:55,672 --> 00:06:56,547
Quick check.

209
00:06:57,097 --> 00:06:59,123
Why is a bare except a bad idea?

210
00:06:59,673 --> 00:07:01,935
Which level would you use for a failed attempt?

211
00:07:02,485 --> 00:07:04,575
Why does the wait grow between retries?

212
00:07:05,125 --> 00:07:06,981
Which failures are worth retrying?

